for a couple of reasons,

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:20.870
maybe because you
went to troubleshoot,

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:24.060
you want to monitor
something, or understand

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:27.280
what's going on in your
